# ==========================================
# CLAUDE CODE UNITY C# 专注模式配置
# ==========================================

# 1. 屏蔽 Unity 系统生成的巨大缓存文件夹 (必须屏蔽)
Library/
Temp/
Logs/
obj/
Build/
Builds/
UserSettings/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/
Wiki/

# 2. 屏蔽 IDE 和编辑器生成的文件
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.gradle/
*.csproj
.vscode
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svnlite
*.svnwk
.DS_Store

# 3. 屏蔽 Unity 元数据 (对 C# 分析毫无用处的噪音)
*.meta

# 4. 屏蔽所有二进制媒体资源 (AI 读不懂，且极占空间)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tga
*.psd
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.gif
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.aiff
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.fbx
*.obj
*.blend
*.glb
*.gltf
*.ttf
*.otf

# 5. 屏蔽 Unity 序列化资产 (除非您让 AI 改场景，否则这些 YAML 极其消耗 Token)
*.unity
*.prefab
*.mat
*.anim
*.controller
*.overrideController
*.mask
*.physicMaterial
*.physicsMaterial2D
*.cubemap
*.flare
*.fontsettings
*.guiskin
*.mixer
*.renderTexture
*.shader
*.cginc
*.hlsl
*.asset
*.terraindata

# 6. 屏蔽外部包 (通常您只改 Assets 下的脚本，不改 Packages 源码)
Packages/

# 7. 屏蔽文档和其他杂项
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.xml
*.csv

# ==========================================
# 这样配置后，AI 眼里基本上只剩下 .cs 文件了
# ==========================================